{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "en",
  "language_raw": "English",
  "source": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_mizu_020.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/English/script/common_2020_mizu_020.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_01",
      "hash64": "D7D5A314A39314EC",
      "text": "Ever since ya fought for that choice seaweed for\\nme, all my dishes usin’ it have been big hits![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_02",
      "hash64": "D7D5A614A3931A05",
      "text": "Thanks for that! Guess it’s no surprise you did so\\nwell—what with bein’ worthy of Champion Rank![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_03",
      "hash64": "D7D5A514A3931852",
      "text": "Goodness gracious, but do I ever meet all kinds\\nof people while doin’ this job.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_04",
      "hash64": "D7D5A014A3930FD3",
      "text": "I’ve seen people like yerself who run full speed\\nahead like a ragin’ river, and plenty o’ people\\r\\nwho settle down like a calm lake.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_05",
      "hash64": "D7D59F14A3930E20",
      "text": "We older folk tend to prefer the latter, o’ course,\\nbut this ol’ man himself finds that a bit dull.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 99,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_06",
      "hash64": "D7D5A214A3931339",
      "text": "Rivers flow into the ocean. That water then climbs\\nup into the clouds an’ becomes rain.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_07",
      "hash64": "D7D5A114A3931186",
      "text": "I am Kofu the Torrent! Ever changin’—just like\\nwater! Now come see what I’m made of![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_08",
      "hash64": "D7D5AC14A3932437",
      "text": "You really put the pressure on! Guess I should’ve\\nexpected no less from someone with La Primera’s\\r\\nseal of approval! What a catch![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 132,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_09",
      "hash64": "D7D5AB14A3932284",
      "text": "The wildest currents—for better or worse—pull in\\neverythin’ around ’em and have really wild and\\r\\ndrastic effects on their surroundin’s![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 137,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_10",
      "hash64": "D7D21E14A38FFD16",
      "text": "That makes those friends o’ yours who stay by\\nyour side all the more important.[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_11",
      "hash64": "D7D21F14A38FFEC9",
      "text": "Phew! Your youthful vigor’s got my motivation\\nflowin’ up like a rising tide![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_12",
      "hash64": "D7D21C14A38FF9B0",
      "text": "Next time you see Ms. Geeta, tell ’er that ol’\\nman Kofu’s flowin’ and crashin’ more than ever![VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mizu_020_mizu_13",
      "hash64": "D7D21D14A38FFB63",
      "text": "Don’t forget to tell ’er, young friend! And you\\ncome back to see me again, now, ya hear?[VAR 0x0114(0018)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0018"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
